# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: part of the TORCS tracks pack.
Package: TORCS-Tracks-Road3
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-torcs
Environment: any
Depends: TORCS
Description: Road tracks for TORCS (Corkscrew, E-Track 3 and seven more)
 Tracks for TORCS 1.3.7: corkscrew, e-track-3, ruudskogen, g-track-1,
 street-1, alpine-1, g-track-3, eroad, spring. They go into TORCS's
 tracks directory and appear in Configure Race. Install TORCS-Tracks to
 get all 29 extra tracks at once.
